Package: mirageV2
Title: Mixture Model Based Rare Variant Analysis on Genes (v2)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anson", "Li", email = "liyuanrui618@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Shengtong", "Han", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements a high-performance successor to the 'mirage' package for rare
    variant (RV) association testing using a Bayesian mixture model. Implements a C++
    expectation-maximization (EM) engine in log-space for numerical stability, 
    vectorized Bayes factor computation via composite Simpson's rule, and strict
    input validation with S3 output classes.
